-
-```go-html-template {file="layouts/_partials/do-not-do-this.html"}
-{{ if math.ModBool . 2 }}
-  {{ return "even" }}
-{{ else }}
-  {{ return "odd" }}
-{{ end }}
-```
+A `return` statement takes zero or one argument. Passing more than one argument is an error.
 
